    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6974" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναμάχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>renew the fight, retrieve a defeat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.121
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.109
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.24c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸν λόγον</span>
			<i>fight</i> the argument <i>over again,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				286d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phd.</u>
				89c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>make good</i> a loss, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰ ἁμαρτανόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.2.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιπέτειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.55.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φύσις τὴν φθορὰν ἀ.</span>
			nature <i>makes good</i> the waste, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				755a31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ταῖς μὴ ἀνελευθέροις συστολαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					p.71J.
				</span></i>
			; <i>recover,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν νίκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Memn.
					58
				</span></i>
			; <i>counteract,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>.</div>
